UID:7fa32419d9094e8eda459f241a4df7383b08178f5a539ff8d45863d744b2f764@pruts-
 agenda.local
DTSTAMP:20260808T065958Z
SUMMARY:The Hmm @ Brainwash Festival
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
DTSTART:20261031T180000Z
DTEND:20261031T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Townhall: From doom scroll to hope core \nWe’ve all heard the
  diagnosis. Algorithms are rotting our brains\, shortening our attention s
 pans\, and turning us into passive consumers of an endless feed. But what 
 does the evidence actually say? And more importantly: what do we want to d
 o about it? \nIn the last ten years\, the chronological timeline gave way 
 to the algorithmic feed\, and with it\, the way we think\, communicate\, a
 nd tell stories shifted with it. We consume more content than ever\, but d
 o we recognise what’s authentic anymore? And is there anything worth sav
 ing in a life mediated by social media\, ChatGPT\, and an app for everythi
 ng? \nThese are the questions we’re bringing to Brainwash Festival. As p
 art of the “technology = god” programme strand\, we’re hosting a Tow
 nhall that asks: when does convenience become obedience\, and who’s actu
 ally in control? \nAbout Brainwash Festival\nBrainwash Festival is the pla
 ce to be for thought-provoking ideas and visions of the future. At Brainwa
 sh Festival\, philosophers\, scientists\, artists and writers come togethe
 r to explore the big questions of our time and challenge the status quo. W
 e bring together established figures and new voices. We celebrate thinking
 \, doubt and your curiosity. \nBrainwash Festival 2026 takes up the theme 
 ‘the shape of us’\, through which it explores\, from different perspec
 tives\, what it means to live together. \nMore information about the progr
 amme TBA. \n📅 Date: 31 October\n📍 Tolhuistuin\n🎟️ Tickets: via 
 Brainwash \n♿ Accessibility notes\nFind more info on the Tolhuistuin web
 site.
URL:https://thehmm.nl/event/the-hmm-brainwash-festival/
CATEGORIES:The Hmm
END:VEVENT
